Abbas (as) Mere Abbas (as) **2<br>
<br>
ay Meri Jaan, Ay Meri Aas,, Abbas (as) Mere Abbas (as) <br>
<br>
<br>
1. Girte Hue Ghode Se Sarwar Ne Sada Di.<br>
aake Sambhalo Mujhe Girta Hun Mai Bhayi.<br>
qaak Pe Jab Gir Padi Zehra (sa) Ki Kamayi.<br>
shimr (la) Ne Tab Aastee'n Gusse Se Chadayi.<br>
<br>
bhayi Kaha'n Ho,, Abbas (as)-- Aao Madad Ko,, Abbas (as) Aake Mujhe Shimre Sitamgar (la) Se Bachalo.<br>
<br>
<br>
2. Zaqmi Bohot Lashe Hussain Ibne Ali (as) Hai.<br>
aankho'n Mein Hai Qoon Zubaa'n Aint Gayi Hai.<br>
sar Hai Khula Gesuon Mein Mitti Bhari Hai.<br>
dashte Bala Mein Ye Sada Goonj Rahi Hai.<br>
<br>
bhayi Kaha'n Ho,, Abbas (as)-- Aao Madad Ko,, Abbas (as) Aake Mujhe Shimre Sitamgar (la) Se Bachalo.<br>
<br>
3. Aaya Qaree'n Shah Ke Jab Shimre Sitamgar (la)<br>
dekha Ke Gardan Hai Dhali Ghash Mein Hai Sarwar (as)<br>
chah Ke Sar Kaatle Shabbir (as) Ka Badhkar.<br>
bole Hussain Ibne Ali Aswes. Hosh Mein Aakar.<br>
<br>
bhayi Kaha'n Ho,, Abbas (as)-- Aao Madad Ko,, Abbas (as) Aake Mujhe Shimre Sitamgar (la) Se Bachalo.<br>
<br>
<br>
4. Aagayi Itne Mein Waha'n Binte Payambar (sa)<br>
roye Hussain Ibne Ali (as) Maa'n Se Lipatkar.<br>
bole Bohot Mujhko Rulaye Ye Sitamgar (la)<br>
amma Mai Har Waar Pe Kehta Tha Tadapkar.<br>
<br>
bhayi Kaha'n Ho,, Abbas (as)-- Aao Madad Ko,, Abbas (as) Aake Mujhe Shimre Sitamgar (la) Se Bachalo.<br>
<br>
<br>
5. Seene Pe Jab Paoun Rakha Zalime Be Peer (la)<br>
jism Ke Is Paar Se Us Paar Hue Teer.<br>
haaye Koi Naize Lagaye Koi Shamsheer.<br>
hichkiya'n Leleke Yahi Kehte The Shabbir (as)<br>
<br>
bhayi Kaha'n Ho,, Abbas (as)-- Aao Madad Ko,, Abbas (as) Aake Mujhe Shimre Sitamgar (la) Se Bachalo.<br>
<br>
<br>
6. Shimr (la) Ne Jab Gardane Shabbir (as) Ko Kaata.<br>
qaak Pe Tadpa Asadullah Ka Jaaya.<br>
ediya'n Ragdi To Kabhi Haatho'n Ko Patka.<br>
aankhein Phirate Hue Sarwar (as) Ne Pukara.<br>
<br>
bhayi Kaha'n Ho,, Abbas (as)-- Aao Madad Ko,, Abbas (as) Aake Mujhe Shimre Sitamgar (la) Se Bachalo.<br>
<br>
<br>
7. Baade Hussain Ibne Ali (as) Qaime Jalakar.<br>
durre Lagane Lage Bewo'n Ko Sitamgar (la) <br>
kehti Thi Zainab (sa) Yahi (parwaz) Tadapkar.<br>
cheenta Hai Shimre Sitamgar (la) Meri Chadar.<br>
<br>
bhayi Kaha'n Ho,, Abbas (as)-- Aao Madad Ko,, Abbas (as) Aake Mujhe Shimre Sitamgar (la) Se Bachalo.<br>
<br>
